WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.364
OSINT must be reviewable.

00:00:02.364 --> 00:00:08.165
Record the requirement, date, analyst, search concepts, source categories, and significant steps.

00:00:08.165 --> 00:00:17.405
Documentation should let another qualified person understand how the work moved from question to finding without exposing unnecessary sensitive details.

00:00:17.405 --> 00:00:23.207
Preserve URLs, access timestamps, page titles, authorship where available, and relevant excerpts.

00:00:23.207 --> 00:00:26.430
Public pages can change or disappear.

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:39.537
Approved screenshots or archives can preserve what was visible at a particular time, but they should include enough context to avoid turning a cropped image into a misleading artifact.

00:00:39.537 --> 00:00:42.761
Follow organizational rules for evidence preservation.

00:00:42.761 --> 00:00:49.422
Record file names, collection times, and any transformations such as translation or format conversion.

00:00:49.422 --> 00:00:58.232
Keep original material separate from working copies when integrity matters, and restrict access according to sensitivity and legal requirements.

00:00:58.232 --> 00:01:02.314
A chain of reasoning connects observations to judgments.

00:01:02.314 --> 00:01:07.257
Label direct observations, source claims, assumptions, and analytical inferences separately.

00:01:07.257 --> 00:01:16.496
For example, a filing may confirm an address on a date; it does not automatically prove current occupancy or control.

00:01:16.496 --> 00:01:21.439
Repeatability does not mean every public result will remain identical.

00:01:21.439 --> 00:01:24.232
Search rankings and websites change.

00:01:24.232 --> 00:01:33.472
It means the method, source trail, preserved evidence, and decision logic are documented well enough for review and reasonable reproduction.

00:01:33.472 --> 00:01:37.554
Auditability protects both the audience and the analyst.

00:01:37.554 --> 00:01:42.497
It supports quality assurance, correction, legal review, and responsible handoff.

00:01:42.497 --> 00:01:53.026
Documentation should be sufficient for the purpose but proportionate: do not retain unrelated personal data simply to make a case file look comprehensive.
